1
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,630
Ready?
好了嗎？ 好了

2
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:07,370
Hi,it's Rachel and Phoebe's. Please...
嗨… 這是…瑞秋… 和…菲比的家 請…

4
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:09,260
-Leave.. -Leave.
在嗶聲後… 在嗶聲後…

6
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:12,200
But I just said "leave."
那個我說過了 

7
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:15,310
I know because you have all the good words.
我知道，因為你都分到好的字

8
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:20,240
What do I get? I get "it's," "and." Oh,I'm sorry, I have "a." Forget it.
而我呢？「這是」、「和」 還有「留言」…我不要

9
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:23,540
-That's silly. -All right. So let's switch.
菲比，別鬧了 好，那我們交換 

10
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:25,980
No,I have all the good words.
不要，我都分到好的字

11
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:28,550
Okay,fine,fine. We can switch.
好吧，我們交換

12
00:00:31,330 --> 00:00:32,660
- Hi... -everybody...
嗨… 大家好

13
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:33,880
-It's... -Rachel...
這是… 瑞秋…

14
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,080
-and... -Phoebe's.
和… 菲比的家

15
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:37,420
Wait. How did you do that?
請…慢著，你是怎麼弄的？ 

16
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:39,100
What?
什麼？

17
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:42,800
Oh,you're no ordinary roommate, are you?
你不是普通角色對吧？

18
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:45,230
This is gonna be interesting.
這下有好戲可看了

19
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:49,970
Can we finish this later? I'm going running before it gets dark.
菲比，待會再錄好嗎？ 我想在天黑前去慢跑

20
00:00:50,410 --> 00:00:52,680
-Why don't you come with me? -Really?
你也一起來嘛 真的？

21
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:57,650
It'll be fun! We'll run in the park. It'll be our roommate-bonding thing.
對，一定很好玩，去公園跑步 當做室友間第一次聯絡感情

22
00:00:57,850 --> 00:00:59,320
Okay,let's go running!
好，我們去跑步

23
00:00:59,590 --> 00:01:01,990
-There's cute guys there. -Let's run towards them!
而且那裡有帥哥 那就往他們跑過去

25
00:01:03,830 --> 00:01:05,590
Wait just one more second.
你等我一下

26
00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:08,590
Hi,it's Phoebe and Rachel's. Please leave a message. Thanks!
嗨，這是瑞秋和菲比的家 請在嗶聲後留言，謝謝

27
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,700
Wait a minute. You took all the words!
等等，你都講完了

28
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:14,530
You've met your match, Rachel Greene!
你遇到對手了，瑞秋葛林

29
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:18,340
The One Where Phoebe Runs
本集播出： 「喬伊的煩惱」

00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,340
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

30
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,570
I just finished this fascinating book.
我剛看完一本很棒的書

31
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:59,970
By the year 2030, there'll be computers...
到了2030年，有些電腦

32
00:02:00,250 --> 00:02:05,240
that can carry out the same amount of functions as a human brain.
能執行跟人腦一樣多的功能

33
00:02:05,550 --> 00:02:07,610
So,theoretically, you could download...
所以理論上你可以下載

34
00:02:07,820 --> 00:02:11,260
your thoughts and memories into this computer...
你的思想記憶到這種電腦上

35
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:15,720
and live forever as a machine.
然後以機器的形態長生不死

37
00:02:19,900 --> 00:02:23,740
And I just realized I can sleep with my eyes open.
我剛發現我能睜著眼睛睡覺

38
00:02:27,810 --> 00:02:31,610
Honey,it was a great idea, nailing the boxes to the floor.
把箱子釘在地上真是聰明

39
00:02:33,780 --> 00:02:37,110
-I didn't nail the boxes to the floor. -So you can move them!
我沒把箱子釘在地上 所以你可以搬走羅

40
00:02:38,650 --> 00:02:42,350
And while I'm doing that, Ross has a great computer story for you.
可以，我這就搬 羅斯有個很好聽的電腦故事

42
00:02:45,130 --> 00:02:47,590
Hey,everybody! I'd like you to meet Janine.
大家好，這是吉寧

43
00:02:47,830 --> 00:02:49,800
She's gonna be my new roommate!
她是我的新室友

44
00:02:51,471 --> 00:02:52,768
你好

45
00:02:54,170 --> 00:02:56,160
And she's gonna live with me!
她要來跟我住

46
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,870
It's nice to meet you. Janine...?
很高興認識你，吉寧… 

47
00:03:00,140 --> 00:03:01,340
Le Croix.
勒誇，吉寧勒誇

48
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:04,340
I didn't know that. What a pretty last name.
我都不知道，好好聽的姓

49
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,210
So where are you from?
你是哪裡人？

50
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:09,450
Australia. I just moved here.
奧洲人，2星期前剛到

51
00:03:09,650 --> 00:03:11,120
From the land down under?
來自南半球？

52
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,380
I didn't know that either!
這個我也不知道

53
00:03:14,690 --> 00:03:16,280
So what do you do?
你做哪一行？

54
00:03:16,490 --> 00:03:19,290
-I'm a dancer. -You're a dancer?
我是個舞者 你是個舞者？

55
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:21,530
She's a dancer!
她是個舞者

56
00:03:23,730 --> 00:03:26,130
I think I'll go unpack.
我要去整理東西了 我幫你開門

57
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,304
喬伊

58
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:40,070
Did you interview her before you asked her to move in?
你叫她搬來之前有先面試嗎？ 

59
00:03:40,380 --> 00:03:41,870
Of course!
當然有

60
00:03:42,050 --> 00:03:43,540
What did you ask her?
你到底問了什麼？ 

61
00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:45,550
When can you move in?
「你什麼時候可以搬來？」

62
00:03:48,090 --> 00:03:50,990
Thank you for bringing her into our lives.
謝謝你把她帶到我們身邊

63
00:03:51,830 --> 00:03:53,260
Unbelievable.
難以置信

64
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:54,720
Down,boy.
別太興奮

65
00:03:54,900 --> 00:03:58,460
Oh,no,no,no. She's not my type. Not for me,she's not my type. She's too..
她不是我喜歡的型，她太…

66
00:03:58,630 --> 00:04:01,800
Beautiful,tall,sexy, showing her stomach?
美麗、高挑、性感、露肚臍？

67
00:04:01,970 --> 00:04:03,700
Look at all the boxes!
你看這堆箱子

68
00:04:05,610 --> 00:04:07,870
I cannot wait to ask her out.
我好想趕快約她

69
00:04:08,110 --> 00:04:11,370
Wait a minute. You can't. She's your roommate.
喬伊，你不能約她 她是你的室友

70
00:04:11,650 --> 00:04:13,010
It'll be too complicated.
那樣會太複雜 

71
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,710
Yeah,don't do it.
沒錯，千萬不要

72
00:04:14,980 --> 00:04:18,320
I mean,if you date her, then I can't date her.
你約了她，我就不能約她了

73
00:04:19,350 --> 00:04:22,620
What if you started going out with her and it didn't work out?
要是你跟她交往又分手呢？ 

74
00:04:22,790 --> 00:04:24,550
That's when I make my move.
那就該我行動了

75
00:04:25,490 --> 00:04:28,330
Remember when you broke up with Donna...
你之前跟一個唐娜交往 後來分手

76
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:31,800
how horrible it was when you bumped into her at the supermarket?
記得你們在超市巧遇的尷尬嗎

77
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:33,470
Oh,God,yeah.
沒錯

78
00:04:33,740 --> 00:04:36,300
Now imagine you live at the supermarket.
想像你住在超市裡 

79
00:04:36,570 --> 00:04:37,730
Okay!
好啊

80
00:04:38,945 --> 00:04:39,912
不是

81
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:44,240
You're right! I don't want that. I can't date her.
你說得對，那樣很不好 我不能約她

82
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:48,510
You'd better watch the flirting too, because it could be trouble.
最好也別跟她調情 住得這麼近可能會出事

83
00:04:48,820 --> 00:04:50,580
Well,that's gonna be tough, Mon.
太難了

84
00:04:50,850 --> 00:04:54,190
It's hard for me to be around an attractive woman and not flirt.
畢竟美女當前 我很難不打情罵俏

85
00:04:55,260 --> 00:04:58,280
You're around me all the time, and you don't flirt.
我老是在你面前，你也沒怎樣

86
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:01,590
A little sad about that, sweetie?
有點難過是吧？

87
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:10,370
I have to tie my shoes, so you go ahead. I'll catch up.
我要綁鞋帶，你先跑，我就來 好

88
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:18,380
Come on, that's not running! Let's go!
拜託，那哪叫跑步，快點

89
00:05:24,150 --> 00:05:26,310
I'm telling you,when she runs...
我是說真的，她跑步的時候 

90
00:05:26,550 --> 00:05:28,650
she looks like Kermit the Frog...
就像大嘴蛙...

91
00:05:28,890 --> 00:05:30,880
and the Six Million Dollar Man.
和生化機器人合體

92
00:05:32,190 --> 00:05:35,650
Monica had such a crush on him.
摩妮卡以前好喜歡他

93
00:05:35,900 --> 00:05:40,360
She used to kiss his poster every night before she went to bed.
她睡覺之前都會親他的海報

94
00:05:40,670 --> 00:05:41,760
I used to do that too!
我也會

95
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:45,370
Did you also have his album, "It's Not Easy Being Green"?
你有他的專輯 「全身綠色的煩惱」 嗎？

96
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,110
Oh,Mon.
摩妮卡…

97
00:05:51,350 --> 00:05:53,080
So Phoebe runs weird, huh?
所以菲比的姿勢很怪？

98
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:56,380
Yeah. And I know she'll want to run again.
對，而且她還會想再去跑 

99
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:59,550
I don't know how to get out of it. I mean,I live with her.
我躲不掉，我跟她住在一起

100
00:05:59,850 --> 00:06:02,850
Why don't you be straight with her? Tell her the truth.
你就實話實說嘛

101
00:06:03,090 --> 00:06:06,580
You're right. I should just tell her the truth.
你說得對，我應該跟她直說

102
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:12,030
Phoebe, Monica tripped me. I don't think I can ever run again,ever!
菲比，摩妮卡把我絆倒 我再也不能跑步了

103
00:06:13,630 --> 00:06:17,370
But we were having so much fun. All those cute guys were checking us out.
但是我們跑得好開心 那些帥哥都在看我們

104
00:06:17,540 --> 00:06:20,530
I know. They were definitely staring.
就是啊，他們都瞪著我們看

105
00:06:21,980 --> 00:06:24,140
Why? Why would you do that?
你為什麼要絆倒她？ 

106
00:06:24,650 --> 00:06:26,370
I don't know.
我不知道

107
00:06:27,250 --> 00:06:29,410
Rachel,I'm sorry I hurt your ankles.
瑞秋，抱歉害你兩個腳踝受傷

108
00:06:29,850 --> 00:06:32,150
-Ankle. -We'll see.
只有一個 等著瞧

109
00:06:36,820 --> 00:06:39,050
Okay. I am officially unpacked.
好，東西都拿出來了 

110
00:06:39,330 --> 00:06:40,990
Thanks for helping me,man.
多謝幫忙

111
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:42,890
Joe?
喬伊？

112
00:06:49,500 --> 00:06:51,770
Well,I guess Joey went home.
看來他回家了

113
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:56,400
And look,there is still one box I have to unpack.
看，還有一個箱子沒拆

114
00:06:59,910 --> 00:07:01,210
I got you!
你被騙了

115
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:06,110
Oh,my God, you almost gave me a heart attack.
天哪，我差點被嚇出心臟病

116
00:07:06,950 --> 00:07:09,420
It was so hard not to laugh.
我憋笑憋得好辛苦

117
00:07:10,290 --> 00:07:12,350
Hey, the place looks great.
很像回事嘛 

118
00:07:12,630 --> 00:07:13,690
Not bad,right?
不賴吧？

119
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:17,800
Monica's working late, so I'm gonna make this place spotless.
摩妮卡今天要加班 我要把這裡打掃得一塵不染

120
00:07:18,430 --> 00:07:19,700
You know what else I'll do?
還有還有 

121
00:07:19,970 --> 00:07:22,800
I'm gonna go downstairs and get her some flowers.
我還要下樓去買花送她

122
00:07:23,100 --> 00:07:24,900
Who wouldn't want to live with me?
誰會不想跟我住？ 

123
00:07:25,370 --> 00:07:26,470
I don't.
我不想

124
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:30,900
No,I want to live with the super-hot Australian dancer!
我想跟性感的奧洲舞者住

125
00:07:31,210 --> 00:07:34,080
How's that going? Are you okay with the not-flirting thing?
情況如何？你能不打情罵俏嗎

126
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:36,150
So far. But it's tough.
目前還可以，但是好累

127
00:07:36,450 --> 00:07:40,550
I've got this built-up flirting energy, and I don't know how to get rid of it.
我的調情能量一直累積 無處發洩

128
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,950
How you doing?
你好嗎？

129
00:07:47,460 --> 00:07:48,860
Get out!
滾啦

130
00:07:54,270 --> 00:07:55,900
Oh,man!
天哪

131
00:07:57,370 --> 00:07:59,670
Sorry. There's just more room out here.
抱歉，客廳比較寬

132
00:07:59,910 --> 00:08:05,040
No,you just reminded me that I have to do my stretches too.
不是，我只是想到 我也該拉拉筋了

133
00:08:11,350 --> 00:08:12,910
Why don't you try to be...?
你應該…

134
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:15,590
-What's wrong? -Nothing.
怎麼了？ 沒事

135
00:08:15,860 --> 00:08:17,590
I didn't want you to touch me...
你不要碰我 

136
00:08:17,860 --> 00:08:20,920
because I'm all sweaty from the workout.
我拉筋拉得全身是汗

137
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:22,790
I'm gonna hit the shower.
我去洗個澡

138
00:08:25,970 --> 00:08:27,560
Oh,my God!
我的天哪

139
00:08:27,770 --> 00:08:29,740
Sorry about that stuff hanging in there.
抱歉在浴室晾衣服 

140
00:08:29,940 --> 00:08:32,800
It's just my thongs are too delicate for the dryer.
我的丁字褲很嬌貴，不能烘乾

141
00:08:45,950 --> 00:08:47,480
Oh,yeah,it's me.
沒錯，是我 

142
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:50,780
I saw you grab your running shoes this morning and sneak out.
我看到你抄了慢跑鞋溜出來

143
00:08:51,130 --> 00:08:53,290
You lied so you could run by yourself.
你騙我好自己跑步

144
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:55,550
No,Phoebe,no. I was....
不是，我沒有 我是…

145
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,420
I was actually just checking...
我只是跑跑看… 

146
00:08:57,670 --> 00:08:58,790
to see...

147
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,760
if I could run. And I can!
看我能不能跑，結果可以

148
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,440
Please,I'm not an idiot.
拜託，我又不是白癡 

149
00:09:02,740 --> 00:09:04,000
No,wait. Phoebe?
等等，菲比

150
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:19,650
Wow. Couples who live together do start to look alike.
同居真的會讓人越來越像

151
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:25,090
I am working right now. So say what you have to say and leave me alone!
我在忙，有話快說，有屁快放

152
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:27,750
Sound alike too.
口氣也很像

153
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,860
So,Mondler....
摩德…

154
00:09:33,700 --> 00:09:36,400
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？ 

155
00:09:36,670 --> 00:09:38,800
What does it look like? I am cleaning.
你說呢？我在打掃

156
00:09:39,070 --> 00:09:42,370
Did you get Monica's authorization to move all her stuff?
你動她的東西有經過她同意嗎

157
00:09:42,710 --> 00:09:45,180
I don't need that. I'll put everything back.
沒必要，我會把東西都放回去

158
00:09:45,410 --> 00:09:47,680
Put it back exactly where you found it?
完全恢復原狀嗎？

159
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:51,150
Yes. I'm gonna put it back exactly where I found it.
當然是完全恢復原狀

160
00:09:51,420 --> 00:09:53,910
First of all, that attitude is not helping.
這種態度對你沒有幫助

161
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:57,490
She won't care if I put her stuff back in the same stupid place.
她才不會在乎有沒有恢復原狀

162
00:09:57,690 --> 00:10:01,220
Hello? Did you just meet Monica?
你是剛認識摩妮卡嗎？

163
00:10:02,260 --> 00:10:05,230
She'll recognize that I did a nice thing...
她會認同我的體帖...

164
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:07,160
and appreciate it.
並感到窩心

165
00:10:07,870 --> 00:10:09,860
Actually,this will work out well.
其實這樣也蠻好的

166
00:10:10,070 --> 00:10:12,010
Because when you move back with Joey...
等你必須搬回去跟喬伊住 

167
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:15,230
Joey's hot new roommate can come live with me.
喬伊的新室友就可以來跟我住

168
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:18,370
Oh,I see. You're trying to freak me out.
我懂了，你想嚇我

169
00:10:18,580 --> 00:10:23,210
Chandler, Monica is really weird about this kind of stuff, all right?
錢德，摩妮卡對這種事有怪癖

170
00:10:23,450 --> 00:10:28,120
Believe me,I lived with her for 16 years. She's going to freak out.
相信我，我跟她住了16年 她會捉狂

171
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:30,850
Oh,my God. She's going to sit on you.
天哪，她會壓在你身上

172
00:10:32,090 --> 00:10:34,220
That probably won't hurt as much anymore.
不過她現在瘦了

173
00:10:34,860 --> 00:10:37,020
No,she is not. I'll prove it to you.
她才不會，我證明給你看 

174
00:10:37,300 --> 00:10:38,990
I'll call her right now.
我現在就打給她

175
00:10:40,330 --> 00:10:41,700
Phone's done.
電話擦好了

176
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:46,900
-Hey,Mon. How's it going? -Terrible.
摩妮卡，你好嗎？ 爛透了

177
00:10:47,210 --> 00:10:49,470
If I want something done right, I have to do it myself.
什麼事都得我自己來 

178
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:51,370
Other people just wreck stuff.
其他人只會搞砸

179
00:10:53,210 --> 00:10:55,480
I think I might kill someone tonight.
我今晚可能會殺人

180
00:10:57,750 --> 00:11:00,050
Come on, it can't be that bad.
別這樣，沒那麼糟吧

181
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:02,020
The only thing getting me through...
是非常糟，想到快見到你了 

182
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:04,160
is knowing I'll see you soon.
我才撐得下去

183
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:07,590
I might even try to get out of here early.
我搞不好會設法早退 不要…

184
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:09,660
It sounds like they need you there.
餐廳似乎很需要你

185
00:11:09,930 --> 00:11:13,490
-You're just hanging out with Ross? -It's all good! Okay,bye!
你跟羅斯在一起嗎？ 一切都很好，再見

186
00:11:15,370 --> 00:11:16,730
She's gonna kill me.
她會宰了我

187
00:11:17,370 --> 00:11:19,700
The phone was facing the other way.
電話放反了

188
00:11:20,570 --> 00:11:22,910
And that goes back up there.
相框應該擺在上面

189
00:11:24,450 --> 00:11:28,440
This is good. This is under control. We should start with the big stuff.
好，一切都在掌握中 我們從大型傢俱復原起 

191
00:11:28,620 --> 00:11:32,050
That'll be the easiest. Let's start with the couch.
那樣比較簡單 先搬沙發

192
00:11:33,650 --> 00:11:34,680
I got it.
我沒問題

193
00:11:38,660 --> 00:11:40,520
That doesn't look right.
位置好像不對

194
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:43,890
What are you talking about? The couch is in line with the carpet.
什麼意思？ 沙發剛好跟毯子對齊

195
00:11:44,130 --> 00:11:48,400
Then I can just walk over here and casually put my feet up on....
我可以走到這邊 輕鬆的把腳翹在…

196
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:51,360
Okay, here's what we do.
好

197
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:54,010
We move the couch closer to the coffee table.
那就把沙發往咖啡桌那邊推

198
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:57,230
But then the back of the couch won't line up with the carpet.
那沙發的背後 就不會跟毯子邊緣對齊了

199
00:11:57,510 --> 00:12:00,570
Well,we'll just move the coffee table...
那就把咖啡桌...

200
00:12:00,750 --> 00:12:01,740
closer to the couch.
往沙發那邊推

201
00:12:02,050 --> 00:12:07,180
But then the coffee table won't be centered in the seating area.
那咖啡桌就不在座位區正中央了

202
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:10,920
But the coffee table doesn't match the table!
那咖啡桌就…羅斯

203
00:12:14,700 --> 00:12:16,460
Look, what am I gonna do?
我該怎麼辦？

204
00:12:16,630 --> 00:12:21,160
I'm not flirting, but I'm drawing her to me like a moth to a flame!
我不調情，卻還是吸引著她 就像火吸引著飛蛾

205
00:12:26,470 --> 00:12:28,910
What the hell's going on over here?
這裡是怎麼了？

206
00:12:30,580 --> 00:12:31,940
Monica's gonna kill you!
摩妮卡會宰了你

207
00:12:33,610 --> 00:12:34,770
I need your help.
我需要你們的幫忙 

208
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:38,610
I have to do something to repel this woman.
我得想辦法把這個女人嚇跑

209
00:12:38,850 --> 00:12:40,680
Wait a minute. Wait a minute.
等等

210
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,750
You guys repel women all the time!
你們最會把女人嚇跑了

211
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:46,950
Hey, I've been married three times.
我可是結過三次婚

212
00:12:53,030 --> 00:12:54,130
No, I've seen it happen.
不，我親眼見識過

213
00:12:54,370 --> 00:12:58,170
You get a rapport going with a woman, but somehow you manage to kill it.
你們跟女人交往得好好的 最後卻總是能搞砸

214
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:02,140
Time after time after time after time.
一次一次又一次

215
00:13:02,310 --> 00:13:03,570
What's your secret?
你們的秘訣是什麼？

216
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:07,340
We do not repel women,okay?
我們並不會把女人嚇跑 

217
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:09,280
That is completely untrue.
完全沒有這回事

218
00:13:09,520 --> 00:13:12,110
Oh, yes, we do, my man.
我們確實會

219
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:15,090
Remember when we went to a dance...
記不記得大學參加春季舞會 

220
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:18,420
and you walked up to that girl you liked and talked...
你走向看對眼的女生

221
00:13:18,660 --> 00:13:21,130
about the lrish potato famine?
卻大談愛爾蘭馬鈴薯饑荒？

222
00:13:22,030 --> 00:13:25,000
What about you? You weren't so hot either.
那你呢？你當年也沒那麼酷

223
00:13:25,270 --> 00:13:27,530
After everything he said, he'd go..
他每次說完話都會...

224
00:13:30,270 --> 00:13:33,500
Monica doesn't like that either. I should stop doing that.
摩妮卡也不喜歡 也許我應該改掉

225
00:13:34,340 --> 00:13:37,370
Girls don't like it when I start talking about science.
對了，女生不喜歡我聊科學 

226
00:13:37,650 --> 00:13:39,810
That's not specific to girls.
不只是女生

227
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:43,680
This is great. What else?
太好了，還有呢？

228
00:13:43,950 --> 00:13:45,710
They don't like you correcting their grammar.
她們不喜歡你糾正她們的文法

229
00:13:45,990 --> 00:13:49,440
And they don't like it when you explain why your jokes are funny.
她們不喜歡你解釋 你的笑話哪裡好笑

230
00:13:50,860 --> 00:13:54,690
They don't like it when you keep asking them if they like you.
她們不喜歡你一直問她們 喜不喜歡你

231
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:59,470
-Man,I am so lucky I have Monica. -I'm never gonna find love again.
天哪，幸好我有摩妮卡 我再也別想談戀愛了

232
00:14:04,740 --> 00:14:07,370
-Can I talk to you for a second? -Sure.
菲比，可以跟你談一談嗎？ 好啊

234
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:16,310
Phoebe,I just wanted to say I'm sorry,okay?
菲比，我只是想跟你道歉

235
00:14:16,550 --> 00:14:18,710
I handled the situation horribly.
我處理得很差 

236
00:14:18,990 --> 00:14:21,320
And I should not have lied to you.
而且我不該騙你

237
00:14:22,260 --> 00:14:24,220
So what should you have done?
那你應該怎樣？

238
00:14:24,590 --> 00:14:26,720
I should have told you the truth.
我應該跟你說實話

239
00:14:27,730 --> 00:14:29,200
Which is?
而實話是…

240
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:34,600
Well,the reason I didn't want to go running with you is...
我之所以不想跟你跑步 

241
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,400
because...
是因為…

242
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:39,940
the way that you run is just a little....
你跑步的姿勢有點…

243
00:14:42,510 --> 00:14:43,940
-So? -It's embarrassing.
所以呢？ 很尷尬

244
00:14:44,210 --> 00:14:46,410
People were looking at us like we were crazy.
別人都當我們是瘋子

245
00:14:46,610 --> 00:14:49,450
-Why do you care? -Because they're people!
你幹嘛在意？ 因為他們是人

246
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:52,710
People you don't know and will never see again.
你不認識也不會再見到的人

247
00:14:52,950 --> 00:14:55,080
Yes,but still they are people...
但他們依舊是人

248
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,620
with eyes.
有眼睛

249
00:14:58,130 --> 00:15:01,530
I didn't get embarrassed running next to Miss....
我就不怕跟喘氣小姐跑步

250
00:15:04,430 --> 00:15:05,760
But okay.
但是好吧

251
00:15:05,970 --> 00:15:10,200
I can see why running with me would be embarrassing to you.
難怪你會覺得 跟我跑步很尷尬

252
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:12,070
Okay. You're uptight.
你很緊張

253
00:15:12,270 --> 00:15:15,040
What? I am not uptight.
我哪有緊張

254
00:15:16,910 --> 00:15:20,940
I am not uptight,man.
我才不緊張，老兄

255
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:26,120
That's okay. I'm not judging you. That's just who you are.
沒關係，我不是在批評你 你就是這樣

256
00:15:26,490 --> 00:15:29,820
I'm more free,you know. I run like I did when I was a kid...
我就比較自由 我從小就這樣跑

257
00:15:30,060 --> 00:15:32,790
because that's the only way it's fun, you know?
因為這樣才好玩

258
00:15:33,060 --> 00:15:36,460
Didn't you ever run so fast you thought your legs would fall off...
你從來沒有往前衝到 腿好像快斷了嗎？

259
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:41,570
Like when you were running towards the swings or running away from Satan?
例如要跑去玩蕩鞦韆 或是在躲魔鬼時？

260
00:15:45,270 --> 00:15:46,330
The neighbor's dog.
鄰居的狗

261
00:15:51,310 --> 00:15:52,800
Is this in the right place?
這盞燈沒擺錯吧？ 

262
00:15:53,010 --> 00:15:55,240
Who cares? I repel women.
管他的，我會把女人嚇跑

263
00:15:58,750 --> 00:16:00,080
You can't come in here!
不行！你不能進來 

264
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:01,980
Ross is naked!
羅斯光著身體

265
00:16:04,797 --> 00:16:06,697
什麼？

266
00:16:07,530 --> 00:16:10,860
I couldn't say I was naked, because she's allowed to see me naked.
我不能說我光著身體 她可以看我光著身體

267
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:13,430
Why does anyone have to be naked?
為什麼一定要有人光著身體？

268
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:17,790
Why is Ross naked?
羅斯為什麼光著身體？

269
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:24,040
I had to show Chandler something.
我要給錢德看一個東西

270
00:16:27,010 --> 00:16:28,570
Naked?
光著身體看？

271
00:16:30,850 --> 00:16:32,790
I guess I have...
對，我好像有...

272
00:16:33,390 --> 00:16:35,180
a "guy" problem.
男人病

273
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:39,690
Is it the same thing Chandler had?
跟錢德的一樣嗎？

274
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:47,190
We'll get everything squared away, and you can come back later!
待會再回來 我們搞定了你再回來

275
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:51,500
There's still some of Chandler's medicine in the bathroom.
好，浴室洗手台底下 還有錢德的藥

276
00:16:53,070 --> 00:16:54,470
-Bye. -Bye!
再見

277
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:01,710
Thank God.
謝天謝地

278
00:17:05,490 --> 00:17:07,150
Dude, what'd you have?
你有什麼病？

279
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:11,650
We have no time, okay? We must focus.
沒時間了，我們必須專心 

280
00:17:11,890 --> 00:17:14,690
We've got to get everything back into its original place.
我們得把一切恢復原狀

281
00:17:14,860 --> 00:17:15,850
The photo album!
相簿 

282
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:19,930
There were millions of pictures of the apartment in the photo album.
相簿裡有一大堆這裡的照片

283
00:17:20,230 --> 00:17:22,730
We just match everything to the pictures!
我們可以拿照片來對

284
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,270
That's perfect! That's brilliant!
太好了，好主意

285
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,370
What'd you have?
說真的，你有什麼病？

286
00:17:32,710 --> 00:17:34,770
I've got some beer for you.
喬伊，我幫你買了啤酒

287
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:39,210
Don't you mean "for whom"?
是「幫誰」吧

288
00:17:41,190 --> 00:17:42,280
Sure.
好

289
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:46,190
I was gonna order some pizza. You wanna share one?
我正想叫披薩，你要一起吃嗎

290
00:17:46,430 --> 00:17:49,730
Pizza? It's not like I never had that before.
披薩，我又不是沒吃過 

291
00:17:53,030 --> 00:17:54,260
Is something wrong?
有什麼問題嗎？ 

292
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:58,960
Yeah. I'm depressed about that Irish potato famine.
愛爾蘭馬鈴薯饑荒令我很沮喪

293
00:17:59,910 --> 00:18:04,210
No,I mean with me. Because you seem to be acting really weird around me.
我是指對我 你對我的態度總是怪怪的

294
00:18:05,750 --> 00:18:07,440
All right,all right.
好吧

295
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:10,580
Let's just get this out in the open, okay?
我就明說了

296
00:18:10,850 --> 00:18:12,610
You're hot.
你很火辣

297
00:18:13,390 --> 00:18:14,410
I'm lovable.
我很俊俏

298
00:18:15,520 --> 00:18:19,190
Clearly,there's a vibe going on between us.
我們兩個顯然很有感覺 

299
00:18:19,430 --> 00:18:20,550
But we're roommates...
但我們是室友

300
00:18:20,790 --> 00:18:24,460
and it's a huge mistake for us to continue down this road.
我們不能走上這條路

301
00:18:25,770 --> 00:18:28,260
Imagine living in a supermarket...
想像你住在超市裡

303
00:18:28,470 --> 00:18:29,900
and you'll understand.
這樣你就懂了

304
00:18:32,110 --> 00:18:35,800
Okay? So the question is, what do we do?
所以我們該怎麼辦？

305
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:37,640
There isn't anything to do.
不怎麼辦

306
00:18:37,910 --> 00:18:40,400
I think you're really sweet.
我覺得你人很好

307
00:18:40,610 --> 00:18:43,210
But I'm not interested in you like that.
但是我對你沒興趣

308
00:18:50,260 --> 00:18:51,250
No,I mean....
不是…

309
00:18:52,290 --> 00:18:57,160
You're a nice guy, and I'm happy to be your roommate and your friend.
你人真的很好 我很高興能當你的室友和朋友

310
00:18:57,430 --> 00:18:59,400
I'm just,you know,I just...
只是...只是...

311
00:18:59,670 --> 00:19:02,830
don't feel that way about you.
我對你沒有那種感覺

313
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:07,600
I see what happened.
我知道了


314
00:19:08,180 --> 00:19:10,910
It's because I was trying to repel you.
因為我一直想把你嚇跑

315
00:19:11,110 --> 00:19:16,010
Right? Believe me,you'd feel a lot different if I turned it on.
相信我，等我一放電 情況就不同了

316
00:19:17,150 --> 00:19:19,450
-I don't think so. -Oh,I do.
應該不會 絕對會

317
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:24,460
How you doing?
你好嗎？

318
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:27,930
I'm okay.
我很好

319
00:19:28,700 --> 00:19:29,960
What?
什麼？

320
00:19:31,130 --> 00:19:32,120
What?
怎樣？

321
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:34,960
Oh,dear God!
我的天哪

322
00:19:56,660 --> 00:19:59,220
I'm so sorry. You're right. This feels great!
對不起，你說得對，感覺好爽

323
00:19:59,490 --> 00:20:03,360
And you don't care if people stare. It's only a second. Then you're gone!
對吧？你不會在意別人的目光 才幾秒鐘你就跑不見了

324
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:07,960
It's amazing! I feel so free and so graceful!
沒錯，感覺真的好棒 我覺得好自由好優雅

325
00:20:13,310 --> 00:20:14,830
Watch out for the horse.
小心那匹馬…

326
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:23,040
Can I come in now?
我可以進去了嗎？

327
00:20:31,990 --> 00:20:34,320
-Why is everything different? -Bye.
為什麼東西都變了？ 再見

328
00:20:37,430 --> 00:20:38,830
I don't see anything different...
沒有變啊

329
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:43,730
other than the fact that the room got brighter when you came into it.
只不過你一進來 房裡變得更亮了

330
00:20:44,340 --> 00:20:47,210
The end table is wrong, the couch looks bizarre...
小茶几位置不對 沙發怪怪的 

331
00:20:47,440 --> 00:20:50,710
and don't even get me started on the refrigerator magnets.
更別提冰箱上的磁鐵

332
00:20:51,610 --> 00:20:53,200
Okay,don't be mad, okay?
你別生氣

333
00:20:54,580 --> 00:20:58,610
After I unpacked the boxes,I wanted to do something nice for you...
我整理完東西 想做點讓你高興的事

334
00:20:58,890 --> 00:21:01,790
so I cleaned the apartment.
所以我就大掃除

335
00:21:02,020 --> 00:21:05,550
So I moved everything around, and then I forgot...
我把東西亂搬 卻忘了...

336
00:21:05,860 --> 00:21:09,090
where it went back. I'm sorry,I'm very sorry,I'm sorry.
該怎麼復原  對不起 對不起 對不起

337
00:21:10,760 --> 00:21:12,430
That's okay.
沒關係 錢德

338
00:21:13,100 --> 00:21:15,230
Are you afraid of me or something?
你在怕我嗎？

339
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:18,040
Do you want me to be afraid of you?
你要我怕你嗎？

340
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:20,970
Of course not.
當然不要

341
00:21:21,580 --> 00:21:24,740
My gosh, Chandler,what you did is a wonderful thing...
拜託，你做了這麼棒的事 

342
00:21:24,980 --> 00:21:26,780
and I really appreciate it.
我真的很開心

343
00:21:27,450 --> 00:21:30,440
I have this thing where I want everything in the perfect place.
我知道我對東西的擺設有怪癖 

344
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:33,150
But I'd never expect you to worry about that.
但我萬萬沒想到你會擔心

345
00:21:33,820 --> 00:21:35,120
Really?
真的？ 

346
00:21:35,890 --> 00:21:37,050
Of course.
當然是真的

347
00:21:38,090 --> 00:21:39,580
Oh,you're the best.
你最好了

348
00:21:39,930 --> 00:21:41,480
You come here to me.
過來我抱抱

349
00:21:42,630 --> 00:21:44,820
Hold on, okay? First things first.
等等，先做該做的事

351
00:21:46,630 --> 00:21:49,500
Did Ross sit anywhere while he was naked?
羅斯光著身體時坐過哪裡？

352
00:21:53,970 --> 00:21:56,240
It said that by the year 2030...
書上說到了2030年

353
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:59,640
there'll be computers carrying out the same number of functions...
有些電腦 能執行...

